msgstr "Gateway-IP"

msgid "Multicast Group"
msgstr "Multicast-gruppe"

msgid "Apply"
msgstr "Bruk"

msgid "Bus monitor: {ip}"
msgstr "Busmonitor: {ip}"

msgid "The gateway is connected in bus monitor mode. Nothing can be sent or downloaded until the bus monitor is stopped."
msgstr "Gatewayen er tilkoblet i busmonitormodus. Ingenting kan sendes eller lastes ned før busmonitoren er stoppet."

msgid "Not possible while the bus monitor is running"
msgstr "Ikke mulig mens busmonitoren kjører"

msgid "Stop Bus Monitor"
msgstr "Stopp busmonitor"

msgid "The interface requires KNX IP Secure, but neither the project nor a loaded keyring has its passwords."
msgstr "Grensesnittet krever KNX IP Secure, men verken prosjektet eller en lastet nøkkelring har passordene."

